DOMAIN,ad.icbc.com.cn,REJECT
DOMAIN,ad.psbc.com,REJECT
DOMAIN,adv.ccb.com,REJECT
DOMAIN,imageadv.ccb.com,REJECT
DOMAIN,mbads.paas.cmbchina.com,REJECT

